    "title": "<p>The WHO risk scoring system {30306586}</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Reprinted from Ngan HYS, Seckl MJ, Berkowitz RS, Xiang Y, Golfier F, Sekharan PK, et al. Update on the diagnosis and management of gestational trophoblastic disease. Int J Gynaecol Obstet. 2018 Oct;143 Suppl 2:79-85. Under Creative Commons Attribution License (CC BY).",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGridLight\" style=\"width: 691.05pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"0\" width=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 3.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.5pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>WHO risk factor scoring with FIGO staging</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.85pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid;\" align=\"center\"><strong>0</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid;\" align=\"center\"><strong>1</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid;\" align=\"center\"><strong>2</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid;\" align=\"center\"><strong>4</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Age</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&lt;&nbsp;40&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&gt;&nbsp;40&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&ndash;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&ndash;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Antecedent pregnancy</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Mole</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Abortion</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Term</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&ndash;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Interval from index pregnancy</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&lt;&nbsp;4&nbsp;months</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">4&ndash;6&nbsp;months</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">7&ndash;12&nbsp;months</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&gt;&nbsp;12&nbsp;months</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Pretreatment hCG</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&lt;&nbsp;10<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;mIU/mL</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&gt;&nbsp;10<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;to 10<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;mIU/mL</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&gt;&nbsp;10<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;to 10<sup>5</sup>&nbsp;mIU/mL</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&gt; 10<sup>5</sup>&nbsp;mIU/mL</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Largest tumour size including uterus</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&ndash;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">3&ndash;4&nbsp;cm</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&ge;&nbsp;5&nbsp;cm</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&ndash;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Site of metastases including uterus</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Lung</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Spleen, kidney</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Gastrointestinal tract</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Brain, liver</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Number of metastases identified</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&ndash;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">1&ndash;4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">5&ndash;8</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&gt;&nbsp;8</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.5pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Previous failed chemotherapy</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.85pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&ndash;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&ndash;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Single drug</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 111.9pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"149\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Two or more drugs</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
  {
